<title>JAPAN: KVK - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>KVK - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.46		vs	   10.12</p>
<p> Operating	  348    million	  vs	  829    million</p>
<p> Current	    358    million	  vs	  847    million</p>
<p> Net		  219    million	  vs	  455    million</p>
<p> EPS		   13.59 yen	  vs	   32.38 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     17 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - KVK Corp is a manufacturer and retailer of hydrants for shower equipment etc..</p>
